							<td id="article_title" colspan="2"><a href="http://www.hdtvmagazine.com/test/2011/02/3dtv-are-competing-technologies-necessary-including-autostereoscopic.php">3DTV - Are Competing Technologies Necessary? Including Auto-stereoscopic?</a></td>
						</tr><tr>
							<td id="article_byline">
								by <b>Shane Sturgeon</b> on <b>February 24, 2011</b>
							</td><td id="article_category">
